      "content": "\n            <h2>✏️ 练习测试</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"exercise-grid\">\n                <div class=\"exercise-item\">\n                    <div class=\"question\">第1题：<span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">2</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">5</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">1</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">5</span></span> = ?"
